# An original ballad written for Inharmonia: I–V–vi–IV in the verse,
# vi–IV–I–V in the chorus, broken chords in the left hand.
title: Window Light
piece: window-light
added: 2026-10-17
source: original
author: Inharmonia
key: G major
meter: 4/4
tempo: 72
summary: A slow original ballad over I–V–vi–IV and vi–IV–I–V, with broken chords.
